<title>UK: Rabobank unit adds $150 mln to Feb 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank unit adds $150 mln to Feb 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK AUSTRALIA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT  **$150 MLN	COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    14.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  90.227    PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    88.827    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **INCREASE OF $150 MLN BOND LAUNCHED ON 16.JAN.97.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PERCENT FEB 2000 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
